{"sourceUrl":"https://phy.jlu.edu.cn/info/1052/6984.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:13.297144+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://phy.jlu.edu.cn/info/1052/6984.htm","html":"<div><div>\n\n<div>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><strong><span> </span></strong></p>\n<p><span>为帮助广大优秀学子深入了解我院学科优势、科研实力、导师团队及研究生培养体系，学院将举办校园学术活动开放日，诚邀热爱科学、追求卓越的青年学子走进校园，亲身感受学术氛围，深入了解吉大物理。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>一、申请资格</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1. </span><span>物理学相关专业在校生，专业基础扎实，对物理学及其交叉领域抱有浓厚兴趣，学业成绩优异，有志于继续深造。</span></p>\n<p><span>2. </span><span>品行端正，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></p>\n<p><span>3. </span><span>原则上应为</span><span>2027</span><span>年毕业的大学三年级在校生。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>二、报名</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>申请人须依次完成以下三个步骤，全部完成方为报名成功。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>1. </span></strong><strong><span>网上报名</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span>21</span><span>日前登录</span><span>https://yzbbm.jlu.edu.cn/</span><span>完成网上报名，逾期不予补报。<strong>网上填报信息须与申请材料一致，否则影响录取。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span>注：网上报名仅填写第一志愿即可（志愿信息仅供学院参考）。系统填报时，完成电子签名后须点击【保存签名】，否则无法进入下一步。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>2. </span></strong><strong><span>发送申请材料</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span>21</span><span>日前将以下材料按序合并为一个</span><span>PDF</span><span>文件（</span><span>10M</span><span>以内）上传至指定地址（</span><span>https://f.kdocs.cn/g/P2atYfVk/</span><span>）：</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）报名表（网上报名后系统自动生成，手工填写无效）。</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）身份证、学生证。</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>3</span><span>）由教务处或院系教务部门开具的排名证明（以所在院校确定推免资格的排名规则为准），加盖公章。参考模板见附件</span><span>1</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>4</span><span>）前</span><span>5</span><span>学期成绩单，加盖公章。</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>5</span><span>）其他能证明学业成绩及发展潜力的材料。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>3. </span></strong><strong><span>加入活动</span></strong><strong><span>QQ</span></strong><strong><span>群</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>申请者加入</span><span>QQ</span><span>群（群号：</span><span>570097938</span><span>），验证信息为“本科学校</span><span>+</span><span>姓名”，入群后请按此修改群昵称。后续通知将在群内发布。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>三、录取通知</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>入选名单将于</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span>26</span><span>日前在吉林大学物理学院官网公布。未入选者不再另行通知。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>四、日程安排</span></strong></p>\n<div>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><p><strong><span>日期</span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span>活动内容</span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span>地点</span></strong></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>8</span><span>日</span></p><p><span>9:00-16:00</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>报到</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>QQ</span><span>群通知</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>9</span><span>日</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>开幕式，学术报告，参观实验室，师生交流，参观校园等</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>物理楼、唐敖庆楼、超硬实验综合楼、综合极端条件实验大楼等</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>10</span><span>日</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>返程</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span> </span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p><strong><span>五、交通及食宿</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1. </span><span>对于长春市外地同学，学院安排</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>8</span><span>日至</span><span>9</span><span>日共</span><span>2</span><span>晚住宿，并提供早、中、晚餐，请于</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>10</span><span>日</span><span>12:00</span><span>前完成退房。</span></p>\n<p><span>2. </span><span>对于长春市本地同学，不安排住宿，提供中、晚餐。</span></p>\n<p><span>3. </span><span>交通费用自理。家庭经济困难同学及推免至我院攻读研究生的同学，学院可按硬卧或高铁二等座及以下标准报销往返于高校（或家庭）所在地至长春的交通费。请妥善保管火车票或航空运输电子客票行程单原件。</span></p>\n<p><span>4. </span><span>活动期间，我院为入选者购买人身意外伤害保险。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>六、声明及联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>为保证活动质量，入选名额有限，故不能满足所有申请。欢迎未入选者后续继续关注并报考我院推免生或统考生。</span></p>\n<p><span>联系电话：</span><span>0431-85167955</span></p>\n<p><span>联系人：宇老师</span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span>吉林大学物理学院</span></p>\n<p><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span>9</span><span>日</span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span>编校<span>|</span>宇鹏飞</span></p>\n<p><span>排版<span>|</span>宇鹏飞</span></p>\n<p><span>审核<span>|</span>刘寒雨、杨景</span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n</div>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"df1c198e01bb45a58651b6b62556fb8d1f8dc57ee40aa8efdb005ebee9b1b4c5","textLength":1123,"sourceSha256":"bb79658d05c116c8218a9486f20bd23da5f8586a1d3fea22142f76212a5aecd8","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件1 排名证明参考模板.docx","url":"https://phy.jlu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1935974547&wbfileid=18140464"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-639583aa910439ac4761","title":"2026年吉林大学物理学院2026年校园学术活动开放日的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:13.297144+00:00"}
